lex:tapi-common-occupying-fru
    a lex:ReferenceEntry ;
    skos:prefLabel "occupying-fru" ;
    skos:definition "The field replaceable unit (FRU) that is occupying the holder. The occupying FRU may be only expectation, only actual or both.\nA holder may be unoccupied.\nAn FRU may occupy more than one holder (using or blocking are intentionally not distinguished here).\nCONDITION: Mandatory where an occupying FRU is to be stated." ;
